       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TRPTSLOW.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        FEB 1,1980.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
       SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.             SLOW MOVING ITEMS.
      *       OCT 20, 1981 CHANGES - A.T.L.
      *       1) IF NO LAST ISSUE DATE, INITIALIZATION DATE
      *          WILL BE DATE USED FOR COMPARISON.
      *       2) ALL LINES OF DESCRIPTION ALSO WILL NOW BE
      *          PRINTED RATHER THAN ONLY 1ST LINE OF DESC.
      *
      *       APR 18, 1982 CHANGES - B.J.P..
      *       3) ALL VENDORS ASSOCIATED WITH EACH CORPORATE
      *          CODE HAVE BEEN LISTED.
      *       4) ADDED CHECK FOR "B" IN THE STR-INS-ITM FIELD.
      *          THIS DENOTES THAT IT IS BOTH AN INSURANCE
      *          AND A CRITICAL ITEM.
      *
      *       MAY 14, 1982 CHANGES - B.J.P..
      *       5) ADDED CHECK FOR "1" IN THE STR-INS-ITM FIELD.
      *          THIS DENOTES THAT IS AN INSURANCE ITEM.
      *       6) ADDED A CHECK FOR STOCKOUT ITEMS SO THAT
      *          THEY WILL NOT APPEAR ON THE REPORT.
      *       7) IF REORDER AND EXPEDITE BOTH = 0, ITEMS
      *          WILL NOT APPEAR ON THE REPORT.
      *
      *       JUNE 18, 1982 CHANGES - B.J.P.
      *       1) IF REORDER AND EXPEDITE BOTH = 0, ITEMS
      *          WILL APPEAR ON THE REPORT.
      *
      *
      *       JUNE 1,1983 CHANGES- C.A.K.
      *       1) IF REORDER AND EXPEDITE AND ONHAND ALL = 0
      *          THEN THEY WILL NOT APPEAR ON REPORT.
      *
      *    ON DECEMBER 14, 1984, ADDED THE FOLLOWING OPTIONS TO
      *    THIS PROGRAM:
      *      1.  USER MAY NOW REPORT ON ONLY SLOW MOVERS THAT EXCEED A
      *          CERTAIN DOLLAR VALUE (SPECIFIED IN OPTION PROGRAM).
      *      2.  USER MAY NOW EXCLUDE ITEMS THAT MAY HAVE APPEARED
      *          ON AN EARLIER OBSOLETE ITEMS REPORT.  THE MINIMUM
      *          VALUE FOR OBSOLETE ITEMS TO EXCLUDE IS ENTERED BY THE
      *          USER.
      *      3.  USER MAY NOW EXCLUDE ITEMS THAT MAY HAVE APPEARED
      *          ON AN EARLIER OVERAGE REPORT.  THE MINIMUM VALUE
      *          FOR OVERAGE TO EXCLUDE, AND THE PROJECTED OVERAGE PARM OF
      *          THE EARLIER REPORT, MUST BE ENTERED.
      *
      *    ON DECEMBER 27, 1984, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
      *      1.  TOOK OUT ALL HEADER PAGE LOGIC AND HEADER AREAS,
      *      AND REPLACED THIS WITH A CALL TO THE SUBPROGRAM "THDPRT2",
      *      WHICH WILL PRINT THE HEADER PAGE, ALONG WITH ROUTING
      *      INFORMATION.
      *      2.  ADDED AN ACCEPT OF ROUTING DATA WHICH IS PROVIDED
      *      BY THE OPTION PROGRAM.
      *      3.  ADDED THE EXCLUSION OF INSURANCE ITEMS FROM THE REPORT
      *      AS AN OPTION.  PREVIOUSLY INS. ITEMS WERE ALWAYS EXCLUDED.
      *      THIS OPTION ELIMINATES A PROGRAM CALLED "XTOPSLOW" AND JOB
      *      STREAM CALLED "BXTOPSL", WHICH PROVIDED A SLOW MOVER REPORT
      *      INCLUDING INSURANCE ITEMS.
      *      4.  ELIMINATED "TR29SCRN" AS THE OPTION PROGRAM.
      *      "TRSCREEN" WILL NOW BE THE OPTION PROGRAM ("TRSCREEN" IS A
      *      UNIVERSAL REPORT OPTION PROGRAM WHICH WILL HANDLE MANY
      *      REPORTS).
      *      CIH.
      *
      *       ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
      *       MAY 22, 1985.    V.W.D.
      *
      *       ON DECEMBER 3, 1986 - EXPANDED ALL PRICE/COST FIELD SIZES
      *       TO CONFORM WITH THE CHANGES MADE TO THE STORES DATABASE.
      *       ALSO ADDED COPYLIB WHEREVER APPROPRIATE.     D.A. PLUM.
      *
      *       ON FEB 9,1987 - REPLACED CALLS TO DBEXPLAIN WITH CALL
      *       TO SUBPROGRAM 'TBLOWUP'.   CJR.
      *
      *       ON MAR 13,1987 - ADDED REPORT OPTION TO LIST ONLY
      *       INSURANCE ITEMS.   BJP.
      *
      *       ON OCT. 14,1987 - ADDED DEFAULT DEPT TO REPORT.  AMT.
      *C*  JULY 2, 1993      CR KALMAN
      *C*  WHEN RUNNING THE SLOW MOVER REPORT WITH A RANGE OF BIN LOCATIONS
      *C*  WHOSE VALUE EXCEEDS 4 CHARACTERS (IE, "A-50-A-1" TO "A-74-G-5")
      *C*  A BLOWUP WAS OCCURING. THE PROGRAM TRPTSLOW IS RECEIVING THE
      *C*  RANGE VALUES THRU AN ACCEPT COMMAND. THE LOCATION OF THE RANGE
      *C*  VALUES WITHIN THIS ACCEPT COMMAND CAUSES THE 5TH CHARACTER OF
      *C*  THE HIGH VALUE TO BE POSITION IN THE 80TH COLUMN OF THE RECORD
      *C*  TO BE ACCEPTED. IN THE BIN LOCATIONS THIS IS MOST LIKELY A
      *C*  DASH (MINUS SIGN). A MINUS SIGN IN THE 80TH COLUMN INDICATES
      *C*  SOMETHING SPECIAL TO CL AND THEREFORE CAUSES A BLOWUP.  TO
      *C*  FIX IT A 5 CHARACTER DUMMY FIELD WILL BE INSERTED BETWEEN THE
      *C*  HIGH AND LOW VALUES TO FORCE A SPACE TO BE IN THE 80TH COLUMN.
      *C*
      *C* CR KALMAN        4/26/94            REQUEST 6490
      *C* REMOVED PORTABLILITY COPYLIBS.
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C*
      *C* CA YODER        10/23/95            REQUEST 95-036
      *C* ADDED OPTION TO MENU TO EXCLUDE VENDOR INFORMATION FROM THE
      *C* REPORT.  THIS WAS REQUESTED BY GADSDEN IN ORDER TO SAVE PAPER
      *C* AND TIME FOR THOSE ONLY INTERESTED IN THE ITEMS, NOT THE VENDORS.
      *C*
      *C  09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY FOR SLOW MOVER DATE COMPARISONS.
      *C   ALSO INCLUDE CENTURY IN SORT DATE.
      *C
      *C  08/07/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK     IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                               LOCAL-DATA       IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA
                               C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDITM-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0802
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDOR-VN-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RCD.
       01  PRINT-RCD                     PIC X(132).

       COPY MTLSSORT IN COPYLIB.

      *SD  SORT-FILE
      *    RECORD CONTAINS 347 CHARACTERS.
      *01  SORT-RCD.
      *    05  SORT-DETAIL.
      *        10  SORT-CODE             PIC X(8).
      *        10  SORT-MAX              PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-REORDER          PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-EXPEDITE         PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-SOQ              PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-MTH-FCST         PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-UM               PIC XX.
      *        10  SORT-ONHAND           PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-BINLOC           PIC X(12).
      *        10  SORT-LOC-AREA OCCURS 6 TIMES.
      *            15  SORT-LOC.
      *                20  SORT-LOC-1    PIC X.
      *                20  FILLER        PIC X(11).
      *            15  SORT-LOC-ONHAND   PIC S9(8).
      *        10  SORT-WORK-DATE-CN.
      *            15  SORT-WORK-DATE-CC PIC X(2).
      *            15  SORT-WORK-DATE    PIC X(6).
      *        10  SORT-AVG-COST         PIC S9(11)V9(4).
      *        10  SORT-LAST-VENDOR      PIC X(10).
      *        10  SORT-LAST-PO          PIC X(7).
      *        10  SORT-LAST-DEPT.
      *            15  FILLER            PIC X(4).
      *            15  SORT-INS          PIC X(3).
      *            15  FILLER            PIC X(3).
      *        10  SORT-DFLT-DEPT        PIC X(6).
      *        10  SORT-INIT-DATE        PIC X(6).
      *        10  SORT-ACT-DATE         PIC X(6).
      *        10  SORT-CLASS            PIC X(3).
      *        10  SORT-AUTHOR           PIC X(10).
      *        10  SORT-MANFACT          PIC X(26).
      *        10  SORT-KEY-MOD          PIC X(50).

